    "workingTree": "uncommitted changes reviewed; source hashes below lock the imported files",
    "localFix": "Automatic close-to-tray timeout is reported instead of false success; already-hidden UI remains successful, visible secondary windows cannot be masked. Host and Worker share a same-user/session Windows mutex around scheduled-task commands; the upstream process-only mutex failed the cross-process regression.",
